    "work_id": "oglt_pl/ambrosius/pl16_24_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL16.SA.52",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Christusque nobis sit cibus , Polusque noster sit fides, Læti bibamus sobriam Ebrietatem Spiritus.",
