    "work_id": "oglt_pl/ambrosius/pl16_24_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL16.SA.57",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ecclesiarum principes,duces, Belli triumphales Cælestis aulæ milites, Et vera mundi lumina.",
